---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Monadic Labs privacy policy.">
  <section class="container mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 py-16 sm:py-20">
    <p class="font-mono text-sm text-blue-400">~/privacy$</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl font-semibold">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 rounded-md border border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-500/10 p-4 text-sm text-amber-500">
      Placeholder legal text — this is not legal advice. Have this reviewed by a
      lawyer before publishing, and update it to reflect what your contact form,
      analytics, and any other data collection on this site actually do.
    </p>
    <div class="markdown mt-8">
      <p>Monadic Labs collects only the information you provide directly, such as
      through the contact form on this site — your name, email address, and any
      message you send.</p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Contact details you submit through the contact form</li>
        <li>Basic, aggregated site analytics, if enabled</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>How it's used</h2>
      <p>Solely to respond to your inquiry. We do not sell or share your
      information with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:hello@monadiclabs.com">hello@monadiclabs.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
